Package: ARID
Title: Atacama Repository of Isotopic Data
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Diego", "Mayorga", , "mayorgarmijo@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An open, collaborative repository of isotopic data for the
    Atacama Desert of northern Chile and the south coast of Peru. Provides
    tools to access, filter, and visualize stable isotope data integrated
    with contextual, geographical, chronological, and bibliographic
    variables.
